{
  "comment": "MK3 factory sampler preset set (companion to presets.json). Twelve mk3.sampler presets built on the firmware factory library's own loops and packed multisample strips (assets/factory in the firmware repo, library.json revision 2; WAV copies in assets/sampler/, SHA-256 verified against library.json). Loops are CC0-1.0 arrangements of the kit library's one-shots; the six multisample strips used here are all VCSL recordings (CC0-1.0). Zone layouts are library.json's own tables. Engine params mirror sample.edit on purpose: the params are the knob surface, the edit carries slices/zones/choke that have no parameter equivalent.",
